// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\forum-for-nerds\\README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":70,"lines":["+# forum-for-nerds","+","+> Forum #N — after `hosting-club.de` and nine blog attempts, everything finally","+> lives in one repo. Nerd forum, zero excuses. (Okay, maybe a few.)","+","+**Stack:** Next.js 15, TypeScript, Prisma, SQLite (dev) / MariaDB (prod), Docker.","+","+## Why does this exist?","+","+The author ran `hosting-club.de`, a former hosting forum, plus the ShadowUnity","+Minecraft community. Over the years he built one blog/forum attempt after another","+instead of finishing one. This repo merges all ten of them into a single codebase","+so the next attempt starts from one place, not ten.","+","+## What is this? / What is this not?","+","+**Is:** one self-hosted forum + blog, pure Docker, SQLite for dev and MariaDB","+for prod. Threads, nested comments, votes, blog posts with a","+`draft → scheduled → published → archived` workflow, and an admin panel.","+","+**Is not:** no Discourse/Discord replacement, no SaaS, no 11th fresh start","+(technically it is, but this time with an archive).","+","+## Quickstart","+","+See [docs/DEVELOPMENT.md](./docs/DEVELOPMENT.md). Short version: copy","+`.env.example` to `.env`, install, push the Prisma schema, run the dev server.","+Prod runs via `docker-compose.yml` (app + MariaDB 10.5).","+","+## Project structure","+","+- [prisma/schema.prisma](./prisma/schema.prisma) — canonical data model","+  (`User`, `Post`, `Thread`, `Comment`, `Tag`, `Vote`).","+- [package.json](./package.json) — pruned Next.js 15 + Prisma + NextAuth deps.","+- [docker-compose.yml](./docker-compose.yml) — app + MariaDB.","+- [docs/ARCHIVE.md](./docs/ARCHIVE.md) — per-repo fate table:","+  what was merged, repurposed, dropped, or kept.","+- [docs/DEVELOPMENT.md](./docs/DEVELOPMENT.md) — setup and porting order.","+- `Blog, CMS & Community Platforms/` — the ten legacy donors, untouched.","+","+## The 10 predecessors","+","+| Legacy folder | Fate |","+|---|---|","+| `blog-forum-with-z.ai` | Base: schema + scaffold |","+| `BlogForge` | Donor: post workflow, slugs, Markdown |","+| `Forumino` | Donor: forum UX; Convex backend dropped |","+| `nextjs-blog` | Donor: MDX content pipeline |","+| `blog-website-frontend---backend` | Donor: admin scope |","+| `blog website (modern ui, admin panel)` | Donor: admin UX |","+| `blog-forum-z.ai` | Duplicate, to be deleted after diff |","+| `blog` | Duplicate, dropped |","+| `blog html, css, javascript and php for backend` | Experiment, dropped |","+| `modern-blog-website` | Prototype, dropped |","+","+Full details in [docs/ARCHIVE.md](./docs/ARCHIVE.md).","+","+## Siblings (separate repos, not merged)","+","+- `forgecms` — Flask blog/CMS, stays independent.","+- `infra-pilot` — infrastructure control plane, different domain.","+- `streuland` — Minecraft plugin, different domain.","+- `aktienwerk` — market-data app, different domain.","+- `drosemann` — profile repo with the hosting-history context.","+","+## License","+","+No license file is granted in this repo right now. Two legacy `LICENSE` files","+still sit inside the legacy folders and are untouched. The author was the sole","+contributor to all donors; license cleanup is his call."]}]}]}
